{ Welcome to the country of Czech, in the Pirc Region! This study will cover the hypermodern Pribyl System or Czech Defense, a close kin of the Pirc. The basic setup is d6, Nf6, and c6. } { [%csl Bf6,Bd6,Bc6] }
4. f4 Qa5 5. Bd3 e5 6. Nf3 Bg4 7. Be3 Nbd7 { The absolute main line of the so-called Czech defense is given here, but the point of this repertoire is to provide you with an easy-to-learn, flexible system against l̳i̳t̳e̳r̳a̳l̳l̳y̳ ̳e̳v̳e̳r̳y̳t̳h̳i̳n̳g̳ White plays. Good Luck! And most importantly, s̴t̴u̴d̴y̴ ̴t̴h̴e̴o̴r̴y̴ have fun! } *


