1. e4 d6 2. d4 Nf6 { [%csl Bf6,Re4][%cal Yf6e4] } 3. Nc3 c6 4. f4 { [%csl Bf4,Bd4,Be4][%cal Ge4e5] } 4... Qa5 { [%csl Gf6,Re4][%cal Yf6e4] } 5. Bd3 (5. e5 Ne4 6. Bd2 (6. Qf3 d5 7. Bd3 c5 (7... Nxc3 8. Bd2 { [%csl Ra5][%cal Rd2a5] }) 8. Bxe4 dxe4 9. Qxe4 cxd4 10. Qxd4 Nc6 11. Qd5 Qb6) 6... Nxd2 7. Qxd2) 5... e5 6. Nf3 Bg4 7. Be3 Nbd7 { With the absolute main line as shown in the intro.
