1. d4 { [%clk 0:03:00] } 1... c6 { This was actually a mouse-slip - I was intending c5 instead. After e4, I could have gone into Caro-Kann Defense, but for some reason I didn't and I easily slipped back into Czech defense ideas. I had assumed my opponent would play the London at first, but maybe my opponent realized that they had mouse-slipped e4 on the first move as well. 😂 } { [%clk 0:03:00] } 2. e4 { [%clk 0:02:59] } 2... Nf6 { [%clk 0:02:58] } 3. Bd3 { [%clk 0:02:57] } 3... d6 { [%csl Gf6,Gd6,Gc6] [%clk 0:02:56] } 4. Ne2 { [%clk 0:02:55] } 4... e5 { [%clk 0:02:53] } 5. c3 { [%clk 0:02:47] } 5... exd4 { [%clk 0:02:46] } 6. cxd4 { [%clk 0:02:46] } 6... Be7 { [%clk 0:02:43] } 7. Qc2 { [%clk 0:02:45] } 7... Nbd7 { [%clk 0:02:35] } 8. Bf4 { [%clk 0:02:40] } 8... Nh5 { [%clk 0:02:30] } 9. Be3 { [%clk 0:02:36] } 9... Nhf6 { [%clk 0:02:21] } 10. O-O { [%clk 0:02:34] } 10... c5 { [%clk 0:01:58] } 11. d5 { [%clk 0:02:30] } 11... Ne5 { [%clk 0:01:56] } 12. Bb5+ { [%clk 0:02:26] } 12... Bd7 { [%clk 0:01:55] } 13. Bxd7+ { [%clk 0:02:20] } 13... Qxd7 { [%clk 0:01:47] } 14. f4 { [%clk 0:02:19] } 14... Neg4 { [%clk 0:01:45] } 15. Bf2 { [%clk 0:02:06] } 15... Nxf2 { [%clk 0:01:41] } 16. Rxf2 { [%clk 0:02:04] } 16... Ng4 { [%clk 0:01:41] } 17. Rf1 { [%clk 0:02:02] } 17... Ne3 { [%clk 0:01:40] } 18. Qc1 { [%clk 0:01:59] } 18... Nxf1 { [%clk 0:01:39] } 19. Qxf1 { [%clk 0:01:58] } 19... Qb5 { [%clk 0:01:36] } 20. b3 { [%clk 0:01:55] } 20... Bf6 { [%clk 0:01:31] } 21. Nbc3 { [%clk 0:01:51] } 21... Bxc3 { [%clk 0:01:29] } 22. Nxc3 { [%clk 0:01:51] } 22... Qxf1+ { [%clk 0:01:28] } 23. Rxf1 { [%clk 0:01:49] } 23... a6 { [%clk 0:01:27] } 24. e5 { [%clk 0:01:48] } 24... dxe5 { [%clk 0:01:26] } 25. fxe5 { [%clk 0:01:48] } 25... O-O { [%clk 0:01:19] } 26. Ne4 { [%clk 0:01:45] } 26... Rfe8 { [%clk 0:01:16] } 27. Nxc5 { [%clk 0:01:38] } 27... Rxe5 { [%clk 0:01:14] } 28. Rd1 { [%clk 0:01:38] } 28... Rd8 { [%clk 0:01:09] } 29. Nxb7 { [%clk 0:01:24] } 29... Rexd5 { [%clk 0:01:04] } 30. Rc1 { [%c